sequenceDiagram
    participant LN as Lightning Network
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant MW as Webhook Middleware
    participant WSV as WebhookSignatureValidator
    participant TS as Timestamp Validator
    participant HMAC as HMAC Generator
    participant WH as Webhook Handler
    participant PSM as Payment State Machine
    participant DB as Database

    LN->>API: POST /api/webhooks/payment
    Note over LN,API: Headers: x-webhook-signature, x-webhook-timestamp<br/>Body: payment event data

    API->>MW: Forward Request
    MW->>WSV: verifyWebhookRequest(req)

    rect rgb(200, 150, 255)
        Note over WSV: Step 1: Extract Headers
        WSV->>WSV: Extract signature header
        WSV->>WSV: Extract timestamp header
        WSV->>WSV: Parse request body

        alt Missing Headers
            WSV-->>MW: Throw MissingWebhookHeadersError
            MW-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
            API-->>LN: 401 Unauthorized
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 200, 150)
        Note over WSV,TS: Step 2: Validate Timestamp
        WSV->>TS: validateTimestamp(timestamp)
        TS->>TS: now - timestamp > 300s?

        alt Timestamp Expired
            TS-->>WSV: Throw WebhookTimestampExpiredError
            WSV-->>MW: 403 Forbidden (Replay Attack)
            MW-->>API: 403 Forbidden
            API-->>LN: 403 Forbidden
        end

        TS-->>WSV: Valid Timestamp
    end

    rect rgb(150, 255, 200)
        Note over WSV,HMAC: Step 3: Verify HMAC Signature
        WSV->>HMAC: computeSignature(timestamp, payload, secret)
        HMAC->>HMAC: signedPayload = timestamp + "." + payload
        HMAC->>HMAC: HMAC-SHA256(signedPayload, secret)
        HMAC-->>WSV: expectedSignature

        WSV->>WSV: timingSafeEqual(signature, expectedSignature)

        alt Invalid Signature
            WSV-->>MW: Throw InvalidWebhookSignatureError
            MW-->>API: 401 Unauthorized
            API-->>LN: 401 Unauthorized
        end

        WSV-->>MW: Signature Valid ✓
    end

    MW->>WH: processWebhook(req.body)
    WH->>PSM: transition(paymentId, newState)
    PSM->>DB: UPDATE payments SET state = $1
    PSM->>DB: INSERT payment_events
    DB-->>PSM: Transaction Complete
    PSM-->>WH: TransitionResult

    WH-->>MW: Processing Complete
    MW-->>API: 200 OK
    API-->>LN: 200 OK

    Note over LN,DB: ✓ Authentic webhook processed<br/>✓ Payment state updated<br/>✓ Audit trail created
